  <title>Tax rates</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Administration</gui><gui>Tax rates</gui></guiseq>, or
  <gui>Tax</gui> on a product, lists the tax rates. Each product is taxed at
  one of them.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Click <gui>New</gui>, or double click a rate to change
    it.</p></item>
    <item><p>Type its <gui>Name</gui> and <gui>Rate</gui>, the letter that
    marks taxed lines on an invoice, and choose the <gui>Tax account</gui> the
    tax collected is posted to.</p></item>
    <item><p>For a <link xref="tax_exemptions">tax exemption</link>, check
    <gui>Tax exemption</gui>, usually with a rate of 0, and choose the
    <gui>Exemption template :</gui>, the form a customer signs. The template
    must be in the templates folder.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>Check <gui>Default</gui> on the rate new products start with.
  <gui>Delete</gui> deletes the selected rate; if products still use it, you
  are asked which rate to move them to first.</p>

</page>
